摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"OpenMAIC for DeepSeek Harness: classrooms, slides, interactive widgets, and Socratic teaching","id":"gh:1333147218","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-openmaic","slug":"THU-MAIC/dsh-openmaic","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","openmaic"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"OpenMAIC for DeepSeek Harness: classrooms, slides, interactive widgets, and Socratic teaching"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-openmaic"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"把 OpenMAIC 带进 DeepSeek Harness。Bring OpenMAIC into DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"`dsh-openmaic` is a DeepSeek Harness plugin that registers four tools and a\nSocratic teaching skill:"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- `openmaic_generate`: tell your agent \"make me a lesson about X\", and the plugin submits the requir"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ement to open.maic.chat, waits for the async generation job, and returns a playable classroom link.\n"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"- `openmaic_slide`: the agent writes one OpenMAIC slide (PPTist-style Slide JSON) and the plugin ren"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"ders it with OpenMAIC's official renderer (text, shapes, images, tables, charts, formulas, code).\n- "},{"id":"p5s5","text":"`openmaic_widget`: the agent writes an OpenMAIC-style interactive widget (simulation, game, or code)"},{"id":"p5s6","text":" per the bundled contract; the code streams as it writes, then renders inline as a sandboxed card.\n-"},{"id":"p5s7","text":" `openmaic_render`: the agent writes an inline HTML teaching fragment (concept card, quiz, walkthrou"},{"id":"p5s8","text":"gh) and the plugin renders it as a sandboxed card right in the conversation.\n- `openmaic-teach` skil"},{"id":"p5s9","text":"l: turns a session into a Socratic OpenMAIC lesson, teaching by guided questioning and pulling in sl"},{"id":"p5s10","text":"ides, widgets, and cards as aids."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What it looks like"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Interactive widget:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Then restart `dsh web` and refresh. The plugin ships its compiled `lib/`, so a\ngit install needs no "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"t `dsh web` and refresh. The plugin ships its compiled `lib/`, so a\ngit install needs no build step."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Config"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Key | Default | Notes |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| `baseUrl` | `https://open.maic.chat` | API base. Point at `http://localhost:3000` to develop again"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"st a local OpenMAIC. |\n| `accessCode` | `\"\"` | Invite code for open.maic.chat. Not enforced online y"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"et, leave empty; fill it in once enabled. |\n| `pollIntervalMs` | `5000` | Poll interval in ms. Gener"},{"id":"p16s4","text":"ation is slow, so 60000 is friendlier than the default. |\n| `maxWaitMs` | `600000` | Cap for one job"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"so 60000 is friendlier than the default. |\n| `maxWaitMs` | `600000` | Cap for one job, 10 minutes. |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## API flow"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"1. If `accessCode` is set, `POST /api/access-code/verify` and replay the `openmaic_access` cookie on"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" later requests.\n2. `POST /api/generate-classroom` with the requirement, plus only the optional flag"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"s you passed. Returns a `jobId` and `pollUrl`.\n3. Poll `GET {pollUrl}` until the job is `succeeded` "},{"id":"p18s4","text":"or `failed`, or `maxWaitMs` runs out.\n4. On success, return `{baseUrl}/classroom/{classroomId}` (or "},{"id":"p18s5","text":"the server-provided `result.url`)."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Scope"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- `openmaic_generate`: generate a classroom and return a playable link.\n- `openmaic_slide`: render o"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ne OpenMAIC slide with the official renderer.\n- `openmaic_widget`: render a simulation / game / code"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" widget the agent writes (a full HTML document). It streams the code while the agent writes it and r"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"enders on completion.\n- `openmaic_render`: render an inline HTML teaching fragment as a sandboxed ca"},{"id":"p20s5","text":"rd.\n- `openmaic-teach`: Socratic teaching session that uses the tools above as aids."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The slide/widget/render tools do no server-side generation; they render content\nthe agent authors ag"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ainst the OpenMAIC SDK contracts (`@openmaic/dsl`,\n`@openmaic/generation`, `@openmaic/renderer`)."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Roadmap"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- Wire the remaining widget types (diagram, visualization3d, procedural-skill).\n- Action loop back t"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"o the model (teaching-agent interactions: highlight/annotate/reveal widget elements)."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The scripts locate the harness checkout from `dsh` on `PATH`; set `DSH_CHECKOUT` to build against a "},{"id":"p26s2","text":" the harness checkout from `dsh` on `PATH`; set `DSH_CHECKOUT` to build against a specific checkout."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
